{"4772950":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"CUBE-push-","steam_appid":4772950,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUBE push is a fun puzzle game where you push blocks for fun profit. Well, not profit, but definitely for fun! As you solve each puzzle, you climb a mysterious tower. This tower pushes the limits of time, space and logic. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Cubey MacPushface. His one goal in life is to find the shiny and smooth cube in the universe--and push it! While humble in many respects, this life path is fraught with peril! I mean, he could have chosen a different path. He might have been a doctor or lawyer. Those paths would have been fraught with many things, but not peril! Here we are on the path of cube pushing, and when it comes to peril, the fraught levels are through the roof!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer of the tower will have different mechanics. Keep climbing to discover new ways to play!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CUBE push is a fun puzzle game where you push blocks for fun profit. Well, not profit, but definitely for fun! As you solve each puzzle, you climb a mysterious tower. This tower pushes the limits of time, space and logic. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Cubey MacPushface. His one goal in life is to find the shiny and smooth cube in the universe--and push it! While humble in many respects, this life path is fraught with peril! I mean, he could have chosen a different path. He might have been a doctor or lawyer. Those paths would have been fraught with many things, but not peril! Here we are on the path of cube pushing, and when it comes to peril, the fraught levels are through the roof!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each layer of the tower will have different mechanics. Keep climbing to discover new ways to play!<\/p>","short_description":"Solve crazy puzzles by pushing blocks.","supp